  "priorExpiration": "2021-12-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6903.01 Permit Required. No person shall use pyrotechnic effects or flame effects in the performing arts in conjunction with theatrical, musical, or any similar productions before a proximate audience, performers, or support personnel without having obtained a permit from the state fire marshal.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6900) #10067, eff 12-29-11, EXPIRED: 12-29-21\n\nNew. #13426, eff 8-3-22",
